    <div class="article-body">

        <p>Lively partners with Royal Mail for most domestic shipments UK to UK. International shipments from the UK are supported by DPD, while international shipments into the UK are supported by various carriers such as USPS in US.</p>

        <h2 id="costs-explained">Buyer shipping &amp; costs explained</h2>

        <p>For the first item you purchase in a specific livestream, Lively automatically selects the cheapest package available from the courier that will fit the item. You will be charged a shipping fee for the selected package type according to the tables below.</p>
        <p>For further items you purchase in the same livestream, our Smart Bundling™ algorithm tries to bundle your orders together into the package you've already paid for. If you exceed the maximum dimensions and a larger package is needed, you will only be charged an incremental shipping fee to cover the difference between the cost of the two package types. For example, if you had purchased a Large Letter for £2.70 and now needed a Small Parcel (£3.39) as a result of bundling, we would only charge you an additional £0.69.</p>

