        <p>Please note that we do not currently support shipments to the Channel Islands or Isle of Man through Royal Mail. These will ship with DPD UK.</p>

        <h3 id="us-to-uk">US to UK Shipping Costs</h3>

        <p>Shipping prices are calculated based on the weight of your orders and the distance they are traveling. Orders from the US to the UK will ship with USPS via First-Class Package International Service or Priority Mail International.</p>
        <p>Our shipping rates are based on USPS Commercial pricing. You can find First-Class Package International Service pricing <a href="#">here</a> and Priority Mail International pricing <a href="#">here</a>.</p>
        <p>Total shipping prices will include the label costs you can find above and a small fee to help cover some of the operational expenses that result from building and maintaining features like Smart Bundling. We will continue to invest in great product experiences and work with our carriers to get preferential rates for our customers.</p>

